---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Zcompressor vs iLovePDF - 100% Safe iLovePDF Alternative | Compress PDF"
  description="Zcompressor aur iLovePDF ka comparison. Janiye kyu local client-side processing iLovePDF ke remote servers par file upload karne se zyada secure, fast aur free hai."
  ogUrl="https://zcompressor.com/hi/vs/ilovepdf"
>
  <!-- JSON-LD FAQ Schema for SEO in Hinglish -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "iLovePDF ke mukable Zcompressor kyu zyada safe hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Zcompressor 100% client-side aapke browser me kaam karta hai, yaani aapki PDF files kabhi kisi remote server par upload nahi hoti. Jabki iLovePDF par aapko files unke servers par bhejni padti hain, jisse sensitive documents ke leak hone ka khatra rehta hai.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Zcompressor iLovePDF ke comparison me bilkul free hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Haan. Zcompressor me koi premium subscription, daily file limits ya page restrictions nahi hain. iLovePDF free users par limit lagata hai aur bada batch compress karne ke liye paid plan lene ko kehta hai.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Zcompressor offline kaam karta hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Haan. Ek baar page load hone ke baad aap internet band karke bhi PDF compress kar sakte hain, kyuki ye browser ke WebAssembly me locally chalta hai.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <Header />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-canvas-soft text-ink py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
      <!-- Eyebrow & Title -->
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span
          class="text-caption-mono font-mono text-link-deep dark:text-cyan-deep uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3 animate-fade-in"
        >
          Security Review
        </span>
        <h1
          class="text-display-lg md:text-display-xl text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] md:tracking-[-2.4px] mb-4"
        >
          Zcompressor vs iLovePDF.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body text-balance">
          Local browser-based compression aur cloud-upload utility processing ka aamne-saamne comparison.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Overview Section -->
      <section class="space-y-6 mb-12">
        <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
          iLovePDF ek mashhoor online document tool hai. Lekin kyuki iLovePDF cloud server par chalta hai, isme privacy risks hote hain jo sensitive documents ke liye bilkul theek nahi hain.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
          Zcompressor is problem ko solve karta hai: saari processing aapke browser ke andar hoti hai aur document kabhi aapke phone ya computer se bahar nahi jaata.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Side-by-Side Comparison Table -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-6">
          Feature Breakdown.
        </h2>
        <div class="border border-hairline rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-level-2 bg-canvas">
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-mute uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Feature</th>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-ink font-semibold uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">Zcompressor</th>
                  <th class="bg-canvas-soft-2/50 dark:bg-canvas-soft-2 text-caption-mono font-mono text-mute uppercase px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-hairline">iLovePDF</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Data Privacy</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">100% Private (0% Server Upload)</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Cloud Servers par Upload hoti hai</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Daily Free Limit</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Unlimited (Koi limit nahi)</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Limited free tasks</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Compression Speed</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Instant Local Execution</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Internet upload speed par depend</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Account / Login</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Kahi Sign-in nahi chahiye</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Features unlock karne ke liye prompt</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Offline Functionality</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-success font-medium px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Offline bhi kaam karta hai</td>
                  <td class="text-body-sm text-body px-4 py-3.5 border-b border-hairline">Bina internet bilkul nahi chalega</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Deep Dive Comparisons -->
      <section class="space-y-10 mb-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] mb-3">
            Local speed cloud processing se fast kyu hai?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            iLovePDF me aapka browser pehle poori file internet par upload karta hai, server queue me wait karta hai aur fir compressed file download hoti hai. Agar file badi ho to upload hone me hi kayi minute lag jaate hain.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed mt-3">
            Zcompressor me file upload hi nahi hoti! Compression aapke device ki CPU memory me chalta hai, isliye result turant milta hai.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg bg-canvas border border-hairline p-6 shadow-level-3">
          <h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] mb-3">
            Aapke Personal Documents ki Poori Suraksha.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Aadhaar card, PAN card, salary slip ya contracts ko internet par kisi server par bhejna privacy ke hisaab se theek nahi hai.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            Zcompressor me aapka data hamesha aapke hath me rehta hai. 100% private sandbox.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <section class="border-t border-hairline pt-12 mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-8">
          Aksar Pooche Jaane Wale Sawal (FAQ).
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-body-md-strong text-ink mb-2">Kya Zcompressor iLovePDF jaisa hi PDF size kam karta hai?</h4>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
              Haan, Zcompressor multiple quality presets deta hai (High, Balanced, Low) aur images ko downsample karke iLovePDF jaisa ya usse bhi behtar compression deta hai.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-body-md-strong text-ink mb-2">Kya offline kaam karta hai?</h4>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
              Haan! Page khulne ke baad aap internet disconnect karke bhi PDF compress kar sakte hain.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Call to Action -->
      <section class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink font-semibold mb-6">Abhi private aur fast PDF compression dekhein.</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/hi/compress-pdf"
            class="px-6 h-[48px] bg-primary text-on-primary text-button-lg rounded-pill hover:bg-black transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-level-3 hover:scale-[1.02] duration-200"
          >
            Compress Shuru Karein
          </a>
          <a
            href="/hi/vs"
            class="px-6 h-[48px] bg-canvas text-ink border border-hairline text-button-lg rounded-pill hover:bg-canvas-soft transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-level-2 hover:scale-[1.02] duration-200"
          >
            Sabhi Comparisons Dekhein
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
